> How do you obtain infinite light? Which trick is that?
>
A magic lamp. Note that it's light of infinite *duration*, not infinite
*extent*. The illuminated radius is the same as for oil lamps and (I
think?) brass lanterns, both of which will run out eventually.

Thus, an easy (if woolly) way to identify a magic lamp is to leave it
on for a "long" time and see if it keeps on burnin'. Then you just need
to decide whether your current game would be better served with an
infinite light source, or if you should bless the lamp and #rub it to
get an 80% chance of a wish. Largely, it depends on the specific game.



